      "### Choose the consultant by the question",
      "- Ethical-code interpretation → ethics-informed consultant or professional ethics resource\n- Clinical risk → qualified clinical supervisor or specialist\n- Legal meaning → jurisdiction-specific legal or regulatory resource\n- Culture or identity → culturally informed consultant with relevant expertise\n- Technology security → qualified technology/privacy resource plus ethical/legal review\n- Organizational process → supervisor, compliance, privacy, or responsible leadership",
