      "- Use de-identified information.\n- Share only what the consultant needs.\n- Consider whether authorization is required.\n- Use secure channels.\n- Clarify the consultant's role.",
      "### Retain professional responsibility",
      "The counselor must evaluate advice against the facts, code, law, role, competence, and client welfare. Conflicting consultations require further analysis, not random selection of the answer the counselor prefers.",
