      "Appropriate ethical-decision documentation may include:",
      "- Date and urgency\n- Relevant objective facts and source of information\n- Ethical question or conflict\n- Client and stakeholder interests\n- Applicable standards, law, policy, and informed-consent terms\n- Principles, cultural/contextual factors, and counselor self-awareness\n- Consultant's role and relevant recommendation\n- Courses of action considered\n- Risks and benefits\n- Selected action and rationale\n- Information shared and authorization, when applicable\n- Communication with the client or others\n- Follow-up and outcome",
